# Build-context filter for the repository root, which is the Sensor image's
# build context (see deploy/docker-compose/sensor.Dockerfile: cargo needs the
# shared test harness at tests/harness/ to resolve the Sensor's dependency
# graph, so the context cannot be the sensor crate alone).
#
# Everything below is either huge or secret, and none of it is ever COPYed.
**/target
.git
.env
.scratch
.agents/
.claude/

# The Companion's own build products. The image's Node stage runs `npm ci` and
# `npm run build` itself (companion-gateway.Dockerfile), so a local
# node_modules — hundreds of megabytes, and possibly built for another
# platform — must not travel in the context, and neither must a local build.
**/node_modules
companion/build
companion/.svelte-kit
companion/test-results
companion/playwright-report
companion/blob-report
